This folder contains changes to the INET CreditBasedGate source file to implement a π² (Processing-in-Interconnect) neuron 
mapped onto the IEEE 802.1Qav Credit-Based Shaper (CBS) protocol, simulated in OMNeT++/INET over a TsnLinearNetwork. 
The omnetpp2.ini file tests the π² neuron mapped to the CBS protocol.

Changes implemented:
1. In the CreditBasedGate.cc file the following subsection of the code is changed. 
handleCanPullPacketChanged(): When a new packet enters the transmission selection queue, 
the idleCreditGainRate is incremented by 1 and EV_INFO reports the updated rate and current credit (qqqqppacket enters the Q).
2. The omnetpp2.ini file - tests the pi2 neuron mapped to the CBS protocol.

Running the Simulation
1. Copy CreditBasedGate.cc into <INET_ROOT>/src/inet/queueing/gate/ and rebuild INET.
2. Place omnetpp.ini in your project directory
3. Run the simulation
